Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(detection): add app.tiktok_argus_signing probe
 (CLO-19)

Detects TikTok Argus request-signing SDK via passive native library
presence check. Ships versions.json offset table with fragility warning
(only v5.4.1 offset 0x88ee0 arm64 validated). Probe is RUNTIME/HIGH,
rank 66, budget 2000ms.

